  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am likely not the first to bring this up so I'll try to move quickly with this recommendation. Perhaps there should be a concerted effort on fixing bugs with VRChat and attempting to bring quality of life updates as a focus on game improvements. I know however for worlds and avatars. it is up to the creator of worlds and avatars to optimize they're creations. However focusing on bug fixes to the game it self over inserting more features. Perhaps as an update would likely improve the quality of life for VRChat. My recommendation would be to focus on bug fixes rather than cramming more features in.",
